    <value>Solutions and systems based on machine vision, video analytics, image recognition, allow you to automate various processes at industrial enterprises, factories, transport and logistics companies. Such solutions are increasingly being used and are very popular among technology, developing companies. Our many years of experience in the field of machine vision and video analytics, many completed projects allow us to guarantee the excellent quality and accuracy of the solutions created.</value>
